type: software
title: "The Knowledge Press: The Family"
abstract: >
  The Family is the second edition of The Knowledge Press. It reads a
  GenealogyKG store built from a GEDCOM file: a browser-based 3-D orchard
  of family trees, and an iPhone, iPad and Mac app that answers questions
  about the family on the device. Built from The Knowledge Press (The
  Forest), which reads a GutenbergKG corpus of books.
